+The other rod does recover it. Height and sideways offset together fix the point on the circle; that is why a program that needs an angle from a direction is given both numbers rather than their ratio. A ratio returns the same answer for a direction and its opposite, and every graphics library carries a two-argument arctangent to tell them apart.
 
